    {
      "bbox": [
        330,
        1303,
        1867,
        1484
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "There has been, naturally enough, serious concern among those both within and without city government as to executive salaries including those paid to administrators and commissioners, their first deputies and other deputies.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2238,
          "min": -1.2216
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 36,
          "mean": -0.011,
          "min": -0.3874
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6989,
        "area_px": 278016,
        "density": 0.02514,
        "chars": 225,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 32.19
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        328,
        1523,
        1913,
        1792
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Currently underway in the City Administrator's Office is a full-scale review of executive salaries. Until that review is completed, and you will all have ample opportunity to present your opinions, no decisions will be made or actions taken in regard to requests for review of salaries within administrations or departments whether for incumbents or for existing or to be established positions.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2292,
          "min": -1.3522
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 69,
          "mean": -0.0063,
          "min": -0.3584
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11910,
        "area_px": 426096,
        "density": 0.02795,
        "chars": 394,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 33.08
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        328,
        1833,
        1809,
        1970
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "We will attempt to come up with a salary pattern for all top executives of the city government, thereby eliminating the need for individual requests for review.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1978,
          "min": -1.0464
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 29,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0047
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4640,
        "area_px": 204240,
        "density": 0.02272,
        "chars": 160,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 34.48
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        322,
        2010,
        1957,
        2277
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "An Executive Salary Board consisting of Dr. Timothy W. Costello, Deputy Mayor-City Administrator; Frederick C. R. Hayes, Director of the Budget; Sol Hoberman, Acting Director of Personnel; Robert Sweet, Executive Assistant to the Mayor; and Constantine Eristoff, Assistant to the Mayor, will administer the Executive Salary Plan and deal with any matters which may arise in the application of the plan.",
